{"type":"after","callId":"call@490","endTime":365057.377,"result":{"value":"Skip to main content\nAdsecute\nWORKSPACE\nOverview\nReports\nCommercial Truth\nInsights\nPLATFORM\n·\nMeta\nlast viewed\nDecisions\nCreative Studio\nLaunchpad\nAutomation\nMANAGE\nIntegrations\nTeam\nSettings\nAD\nAdsecute Demo\nDEMO\n/\nMeta\nS\nShopify App Reviewer\n\nLIVE STATUS\n\nage unknown\nRefreshing\nDATE RANGE\nJul 10 - Aug 8\nLast 30 days\nCOMPARE\nNone\nPins\n\nPinned top-line metrics for the selected business and period.\n\nStore Metrics\n\nStore health and ecommerce output sourced from connected ecommerce providers.\n\nAttribution\n\nChannel-level spend and revenue attribution from synced platform data.\n\nLTV\n\nLifecycle and value metrics estimated from GA4 purchase behavior.\n\nExpenses\n\nTracked expense coverage with cost-model enrichment when configured.\n\nSet cost model\nWeb Analytics\n\nGA4-backed behavior metrics and ecommerce session health.\n\nAI Daily Brief\n\nDaily AI summary generated from the latest available cross-channel performance snapshot."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@490"}
