{"type":"after","callId":"call@551","endTime":392864.677,"result":{"value":"Skip to main content\nAdsecute\nAD\nAdsecute Demo\nDEMO\nMeta\nSearch campaigns, ad sets, ads and clients\nS\nShopify App Reviewer\nWORKSPACE\nOverview\nReports\nCommercial Truth\nInsights\nPLATFORM\n·\nMeta\nDecisions\nCreative Studio\nLaunchpad\nAutomation\nMANAGE\nIntegrations\nTeam\nSettings\nINTEGRATIONS\nConnect and assign provider data\ndemo fixtures\n\nConnect ad platforms, analytics tools, and storefronts once, then choose exactly which accounts Adsecute should use for this business.\n\nCONNECTED\n\n6\n\nFixture-backed integrations\n\nNEEDS SETUP\n\n3\n\nStill disconnected or incomplete\n\nASSIGNED\n\n0\n\nAccounts, properties, and sites in use\n\nActive business\nAdsecute Demo\nDemo fixtures active\nAdvertising Platforms\n\nConnect ad channels and decide which accounts Adsecute should actively use.\n\nMeta\nGoogle\nMeta\n\nConnect Ads Manager to import campaigns, ad sets, and spend.\n\nConnected\n\nConnection:\n\nLive\n\nAssigned:\n\nNot configured yet\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\nUrbanTrail DTC\n\nActive\n\nCONNECTION\n\nMeta account is assigned to this workspace.\n\nConnected\n\nPrimary timezone America/Los_Angeles\n\nQUEUE / WORKER\n\nNo queued Meta work is waiting right now.\n\nQueue Clear\n\nCORE DATA\n\nSummary and campaign data are still preparing.\n\nCore Preparing\n\nOldest stored date: Jan 1, 2026\n\nEXTENDED SURFACES\n\nAds, creatives, or breakdowns are still preparing.\n\nExtended Preparing\nFinish setup\nReconnect\nDisconnect\nGoogle\n\nLink Google Ads to track performance and sync account data.\n\nConnected\n\nConnection:\n\nLive\n\nAssigned:\n\nNot configured yet\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\nUrbanTrail US\n\nFinish setup\nReconnect\nDisconnect\nTikTok\n\nPull campaign metrics from TikTok Ads into your dashboard.\n\nComing soon\n\nConnection:\n\nNot connected\n\nAssigned:\n\nNot configured yet\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\n—\n\nTikTok isn't connectable yet — no live authorization or data sync exists for it. This card is a visible roadmap placeholder, not a working connector.\n\nPinterest\n\nImport Pinterest Ads performance and audience insights.\n\nComing soon\n\nConnection:\n\nNot connected\n\nAssigned:\n\nNot configured yet\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\n—\n\nPinterest isn't connectable yet — no live authorization or data sync exists for it. This card is a visible roadmap placeholder, not a working connector.\n\nSnapchat\n\nConnect Snapchat Ads for campaign and creative reporting.\n\nComing soon\n\nConnection:\n\nNot connected\n\nAssigned:\n\nNot configured yet\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\n—\n\nSnapchat isn't connectable yet — no live authorization or data sync exists for it. This card is a visible roadmap placeholder, not a working connector.\n\nAnalytics & Tracking\n\nBring in attribution, analytics, and organic search visibility.\n\nGA4\nGoogle Search Console\nGA4\n\nConnect Google Analytics 4 to enrich landing page and conversion insights.\n\nConnected\n\nConnection:\n\nLive\n\nProperty:\n\nUrbanTrail Store GA4\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\nUrbanTrail Store GA4\n\nChange Property\nReconnect\nDisconnect\nGoogle Search Console\n\nConnect Google Search Console to analyze organic search performance and keyword visibility.\n\nConnected\n\nConnection:\n\nLive\n\nSite:\n\nurbantrail.co\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\nurbantrail.co\n\nChange Site\nReconnect\nDisconnect\nCommerce\n\nLink storefront and conversion data to complete the reporting picture.\n\nShopify\nShopify\n\nSync storefront events and conversion data for attribution.\n\nConnected\n\nConnection:\n\nLive\n\nStore:\n\nUrbanTrail\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\nUrbanTrail\n\nConnected\nReconnect\nDisconnect\nLifecycle & Retention\n\nConnect your lifecycle marketing stack to monitor flow health, campaign revenue, and retention opportunities.\n\nKlaviyo\nKlaviyo\n\nMonitor email and SMS flow performance, campaign revenue, benchmark gaps, and lifecycle recommendations.\n\nComing soon\n\nConnection:\n\nLive\n\nWorkspace:\n\nUrbanTrail Lifecycle\n\nLast sync:\n\n8/9/2026\n\nAccount:\n\nUrbanTrail Lifecycle\n\nKlaviyo isn't connectable yet — no live authorization or data sync exists for it. This card is a visible roadmap placeholder, not a working connector."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@551"}
